"""Menus, ingredients, recipes and suppliers for the three kinds of restaurant.

Dish: (section, name, price in pence, till name, role, daypart, popularity, recipe)
  role      main / starter / side / bread / drink / dessert / kids / deal: decides how
            often a dish is added to an order (see sales.ORDER_RULES)
  daypart   all / breakfast (cafe, before 12) / lunch (cafe, 12 onwards)
  popularity  relative pick weight within its role
  recipe    [(ingredient key, quantity in the ingredient's unit, prep waste %)]
Ingredient: key -> (name, unit, category, pack quantity, pack price in pence, supplier key,
            spoilage % of what is bought, invoice description, VAT rate)
Supplier: key -> (name, category, delivery weekday 1 = Monday)
"""

